#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from NoiseLearner to NoiseLearnerV3"
msgstr "Migra da NoiseLearner a NoiseLearnerV3"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from NoiseLearner to NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"
msgstr "Migra da NoiseLearner a NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through migrating from IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` to `NoiseLearnerV3`. Both\n"
"classes perform experiments that characterize noise processes based on a\n"
"[Pauli-Lindblad noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), but the inputs and\n"
"outputs are slightly different.\n"
msgstr ""
"Questa guida ti accompagna nella migrazione da IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` a `NoiseLearnerV3`. Entrambe\n"
"le classi eseguono esperimenti che caratterizzano i processi di rumore basati su un\n"
"[modello di rumore Pauli-Lindblad](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), ma gli input e gli\n"
"output sono leggermente diversi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Contesto {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"class was created to allow users to perform explicit noise learning. The resulting\n"
"noise model can then be passed to IBM Quantum `Estimator` for applying error mitigation techniques\n"
"such as PEA and PEC.\n"
msgstr ""
"La classe [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"è stata creata per consentire agli utenti di eseguire l'apprendimento esplicito del rumore. Il modello\n"
"di rumore risultante può quindi essere passato a `Estimator` di IBM Quantum per applicare tecniche di mitigazione degli errori\n"
"come PEA e PEC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` was designed to work with `Estimator`, and therefore it implicitly employs the same\n"
"layer finding strategy as `Estimator`. This strategy cannot be changed; otherwise, the subsequent\n"
"mitigation steps would not work correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` è stato progettato per funzionare con `Estimator`, e pertanto impiega implicitamente la stessa\n"
"strategia di individuazione dei livelli di `Estimator`. Questa strategia non può essere modificata; altrimenti, i successivi\n"
"passaggi di mitigazione non funzionerebbero correttamente.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, there is a new\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"class that is compatible with the `Executor` primitive and the\n"
"[directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"This new model delivers a **white-box** experience by providing the pieces to capture design intent\n"
"on the client side, and a single server-side primitive (Executor) processes those inputs exactly as\n"
"directed — it makes no implicit decisions on your behalf. Unlike the original `NoiseLearner`,\n"
"you control how to stratify your circuits when you use`NoiseLearnerV3`, and the class simply takes a list of boxed circuit instructions\n"
"(for example, unique layers) as its input.\n"
msgstr ""
"A partire da `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, è disponibile una nuova classe\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"compatibile con la primitiva `Executor` e il\n"
"[modello di esecuzione guidata](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"Questo nuovo modello offre un'esperienza **white-box** fornendo lato client gli strumenti per esprimere le scelte di progettazione\n"
"e un'unica primitiva lato server (Executor) elabora tali input esattamente come\n"
"indicato — non prende decisioni implicite per tuo conto. A differenza dell'originale `NoiseLearner`,\n"
"controlli tu come stratificare i tuoi circuiti quando usi `NoiseLearnerV3`, e la classe accetta semplicemente una lista di istruzioni di circuito boxed\n"
"(per esempio, livelli distinti) come suo input.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` also supports measurement noise learning. For each instruction in the input list, it runs the\n"
"Pauli-Lindblad learning protocol if the box contains one- and two-qubit gates, and the\n"
"[TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"protocol if the box contains measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` supporta anche l'apprendimento del rumore di misurazione. Per ogni istruzione nella lista di input, esegue il\n"
"protocollo di apprendimento Pauli-Lindblad se il box contiene gate a uno e due qubit, e il\n"
"protocollo [TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"se il box contiene misurazioni.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Should you migrate? {#should-you-migrate}"
msgstr "Devi eseguire la migrazione? {#should-you-migrate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` only works with the legacy server-side `Estimator`, and `NoiseLearnerV3` only works with\n"
"`Executor` and the client-side `Estimator`. **You must migrate to `NoiseLearnerV3` if you are using\n"
"`Executor` or client-side `Estimator`**. The legacy server-side `Estimator` is deprecated and replaced by the client-side equivalent in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` funziona solo con il vecchio `Estimator` lato server, e `NoiseLearnerV3` funziona solo con\n"
"`Executor` e l'`Estimator` lato client. **Devi eseguire la migrazione a `NoiseLearnerV3` se stai usando\n"
"`Executor` o l'`Estimator` lato client**. Il vecchio `Estimator` lato server è deprecato e sostituito dall'equivalente lato client in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you are using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 or later, read the [Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) guide to migrate to client-side primitives first.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Se stai usando `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 o versioni successive, leggi prima la guida [Migra da Sampler ed Estimator lato server a lato client](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) per eseguire la migrazione alle primitive lato client.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

